            <title>[LU-20196] Add projid option to checkstat</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20196</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Add a "-j projid" option that reads the project ID via FS_IOC_FSGETXATTR, so a single CHECKSTAT invocation can verify UID/GID/PROJID together.  "-p" is already used for permission, so "-j" (for "project") is used.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
